b. Add more interior plant in Office;
c. Increase the use of environmentally friendly building materials;
d. Green office campaign for employees and stakeholders;
e. Conduct regular green office assessments;
f. Setting targets for green office certification

Various initiatives by the company aimed at realizing the Green Office align with the achievement of several Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), such as Goal 3 Good Health and Well-being, Goal 7 Affordable and Clean Energy, Goal 12 Responsible Consumption and Production, Goal 13 Climate Action, and Goal 15 Life on Land. Additionally, PT SMI also implements green building certification programs as benchmarks to assess the environmental friendliness of buildings through the Greenship certification program.
